id=cos-ifs
name=COS-IFS installer forwarder
version=0.1 (shell 0.1)
versionCode=1
author=k_ying
description=[中文] 用转发壳替换系统安装器 com.android.packageinstaller：壳里没有任何安装器逻辑，只把安装/卸载请求转发给你自己安装的第三方安装器（InstallerX Revived、Universal Installer 等），所以上游安装器怎么更新都与本模块无关。需要元模块 Hybrid Mount，并把本模块的后端设为 VFS。尚未在真机验证。 [EN] Replaces the system installer com.android.packageinstaller with a forwarding shell. The shell contains no installer logic; it re-dispatches install/uninstall requests to a third-party installer you installed yourself (InstallerX Revived, Universal Installer, ...), so upstream installer updates need nothing from this module. Requires the Hybrid Mount metamodule with this module's backend set to VFS. NOT YET VERIFIED ON A DEVICE.
